
sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant API as PayLink API
    participant Payment as Payment Processing
    participant Wallet
    participant Ledger
    participant Notification

    Payment->>Payment: Receive biller refusal
    Payment->>Payment: Change payment state to Failed
    Payment->>Wallet: Release held amount
    Wallet->>Ledger: Record refund entry
    Ledger-->>Wallet: Refund recorded
    Wallet-->>Payment: Hold released successfully
    Payment->>Payment: Change payment state to Refunded
    Payment->>Notification: Send failure and refund notification
    Notification-->>Customer: Notify customer
    Payment-->>API: Return Refunded status
    API-->>Customer: Display refunded payment status
